      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 13 · AI Review Manager\nAnalyses new customer reviews, drafts on-brand responses and escalates negative reviews to the team.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/review-manager` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"platform\": \"Google\",\n \"reviewer\": \"Vikram\",\n \"rating\": 2,\n \"text\": \"Delivery was late twice and support never called back.\"\n}\n```"
      }
